        {
          "url": "text",
          "valueMarkdown": "This manifest pins the exact versions of every dependency used by the prior-authorization example questionnaires in this implementation guide. Downstream IGs that reuse these questionnaires should copy this pattern, updating the pinned versions for their deployment. Stewardship model: this manifest is owned and maintained by the publisher of this implementation guide (HL7 Clinical Decision Support Work Group); the dependency versions it references are stewarded by their respective publishers as noted on each dependency. Update cadence: this manifest is reviewed and re-pinned on each release of this implementation guide, and out-of-cycle when a referenced terminology or map package publishes a version that materially changes evaluation results. See the effectivePeriod for the window during which these pinned versions are considered current."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
